{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A FALLEN GOD: S</strong>tep into a stylized open world shaped by the remnants of ancient gods. Once a divine being yourself, you were cast down to the mortal realm \u2014 punished for breaking the ancient order. Now, wandering across frozen glaciers, lush meadows, and endless deserts, you seek the knowledge of runecraft to reclaim your place among the gods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116240/extras/4ce574698434b707f6937effc5fd7a92.poster.avif?t=1773417358\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116240/extras/4ce574698434b707f6937effc5fd7a92.webm?t=1773417358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116240/extras/4ce574698434b707f6937effc5fd7a92.mp4?t=1773417358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE, HUNT, FARM AND CRAFT:</strong> This open world is filled with uncharted lands, hidden ruins, and forgotten temples waiting to be uncovered. From icy peaks to sunburned deserts, every region holds new resources, creatures, and mysteries to discover. Exploration is the key to survival \u2014 the more you venture, the more you learn about the world once ruled by gods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along your journey, you\u2019ll cultivate rare seeds and ancient crops to sustain yourself, hunt strange beasts and mythical creatures for valuable materials, and mine precious stones scattered across the lands. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116240/extras/478ef935b54880a70c38eccf42f58398.poster.avif?t=1773417358\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116240/extras/478ef935b54880a70c38eccf42f58398.webm?t=1773417358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116240/extras/478ef935b54880a70c38eccf42f58398.mp4?t=1773417358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CRAFT RUNES AND EARN THE GODS' FAVOR:</strong> The gods still watch from above. To regain their favor, you\u2019ll complete divine tasks and trials sent by Ares, Hades, Hermes, Hephaestus, Demeter, and Artemis \u2014 each testing a different aspect of your strength. Throughout your journey, you\u2019ll gather precious resources and forge hundreds of unique runes, each enhancing your magic, skill, and might.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each rune carries the blessing of a different god, granting specialized powers that shape your playstyle. Whether you\u2019re a miner seeking rare stones under ancient skies, a hunter stalking mythical beasts, or an explorer charting lost ruins, the path to mastery is yours to forge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116240/extras/0ff86b44c6de67b352ae763f8c3fb60f.poster.avif?t=1773417358\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116240/extras/0ff86b44c6de67b352ae763f8c3fb60f.webm?t=1773417358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116240/extras/0ff86b44c6de67b352ae763f8c3fb60f.mp4?t=1773417358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become a true Runesmith. Forge your destiny \u2014 and reclaim your lost glory among the gods.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4116240?t=1773417358","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4116240?t=1773417358","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116240/70179484c80da5c6a2881036100af8bdb41f29e3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773417358","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116240/70179484c80da5c6a2881036100af8bdb41f29e3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773417358","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A FALLEN GOD: S</strong>tep into a stylized open world shaped by the remnants of ancient gods. Once a divine being yourself, you were cast down to the mortal realm \u2014 punished for breaking the ancient order. Now, wandering across frozen glaciers, lush meadows, and endless deserts, you seek the knowledge of runecraft to reclaim your place among the gods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116240/extras/4ce574698434b707f6937effc5fd7a92.poster.avif?t=1773417358\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116240/extras/4ce574698434b707f6937effc5fd7a92.webm?t=1773417358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116240/extras/4ce574698434b707f6937effc5fd7a92.mp4?t=1773417358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE, HUNT, FARM AND CRAFT:</strong> This open world is filled with uncharted lands, hidden ruins, and forgotten temples waiting to be uncovered. From icy peaks to sunburned deserts, every region holds new resources, creatures, and mysteries to discover. Exploration is the key to survival \u2014 the more you venture, the more you learn about the world once ruled by gods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along your journey, you\u2019ll cultivate rare seeds and ancient crops to sustain yourself, hunt strange beasts and mythical creatures for valuable materials, and mine precious stones scattered across the lands. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116240/extras/478ef935b54880a70c38eccf42f58398.poster.avif?t=1773417358\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116240/extras/478ef935b54880a70c38eccf42f58398.webm?t=1773417358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116240/extras/478ef935b54880a70c38eccf42f58398.mp4?t=1773417358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CRAFT RUNES AND EARN THE GODS' FAVOR:</strong> The gods still watch from above. To regain their favor, you\u2019ll complete divine tasks and trials sent by Ares, Hades, Hermes, Hephaestus, Demeter, and Artemis \u2014 each testing a different aspect of your strength. Throughout your journey, you\u2019ll gather precious resources and forge hundreds of unique runes, each enhancing your magic, skill, and might.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each rune carries the blessing of a different god, granting specialized powers that shape your playstyle. Whether you\u2019re a miner seeking rare stones under ancient skies, a hunter stalking mythical beasts, or an explorer charting lost ruins, the path to mastery is yours to forge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116240/extras/0ff86b44c6de67b352ae763f8c3fb60f.poster.avif?t=1773417358\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116240/extras/0ff86b44c6de67b352ae763f8c3fb60f.webm?t=1773417358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116240/extras/0ff86b44c6de67b352ae763f8c3fb60f.mp4?t=1773417358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become a true Runesmith. Forge your destiny \u2014 and reclaim your lost glory among the gods.</strong></p>","developers":["Shawk Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116240/5212337651f294d6b467c81b2dbbb8078f9f545c/header.jpg?t=1773417358","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4116240/82727076/b0ec3c8447c13a0e38d4b59accb1eb8a1db2c0f6/1762030976/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763732129","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4116240/82727076/b0ec3c8447c13a0e38d4b59accb1eb8a1db2c0f6/1762030976/dash_h264.mpd?t=1763732129","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4116240/82727076/b0ec3c8447c13a0e38d4b59accb1eb8a1db2c0f6/1762030976/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1763732129","id":257225628,"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257225628/2ea7991